# TaskTrack

A small command-line task tracker built with Node.js and Commander.

```sh
npm install
node index.js add "Buy groceries"
node index.js add "Submit report" --due 2026-11-15 --priority high
node index.js list
node index.js done 1
```

The `--due` option accepts a real date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format. The `--priority` option accepts `low`, `medium`, or `high` and defaults to `medium`. Tasks are listed from highest to lowest priority, with overdue unfinished tasks shown in red.

Tasks are stored in `tasks.json` in the project directory. Use `npm link` to install the `tasktrack` command globally from this checkout.
